  ('mth-208-numerical-analysis', 'MTH 208: Numerical Analysis', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Engineering', 'Mathematics', '200 Level', 'Find the inverse of $\begin{pmatrix} 0 & -1 \\ 1 & -4 \end{pmatrix}$.', '["$\\begin{pmatrix} -4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$", "$\\begin{pmatrix} 4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$", "$\\begin{pmatrix} 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -4 \\end{pmatrix}$", "$\\begin{pmatrix} -3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Since $\det = \pm1$, $A^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{\det A}\begin{pmatrix} d & -b \\ -c & a \end{pmatrix} = $\begin{pmatrix} -4 & 1 \\ -1 & 0 \end{pmatrix}$$, verified by $AA^{-1}=I$. [Source: Ch.1, pp.13-15 (“Inverse of a Matrix”)]', 'Inverse of a Matrix', false, 'second', 2),
